/**
 * 39b General Purpose Register File (GPRs)
 *
 * 39b to support 32b register with 7b integrity. Integrity generation/checking implemented in
 * wrapping otbn_rf_base module
 *
 * Features:
 * - 2 read ports
 * - 1 write port
